3. CTA (0-20 pts): Is the call-to-action low friction, unambiguous, and aligned with user intent?
4. CREATIVE FORMAT (0-10 pts): Visual pace, UGC relatability, and platform fit for Instagram Reels/Facebook Feeds.
5. LONGEVITY MULTIPLIER (0-15 pts): Calculated based on active days and impression bracket.

You must return ONLY valid, raw JSON conforming to this exact structure (no markdown fences, no explanatory text):
{
  "hook": {
    "verbatim": "string",
    "type": "Pain-Point Agitation | Question Interrupt | Social Proof | Benefit Led",
